396	/**
397	 * Assigns the owner's {@code namesakeCount}: the number of existing owners that, at this moment
398	 * before the new owner is persisted, share the same first name and last name (each compared
399	 * case-insensitively). Runs after {@link BuildOwner} has produced the {@link Owner} and before
400	 * {@link SaveOwner} persists it, so {@link OwnerRepository#findAll()} returns only the pre-existing
401	 * owners and the new owner never counts itself. Mutates the entity in place so {@link SaveOwner}
402	 * stores the value and later reads return it.
